/span><span class="text-dusk/75">Drive Guard</span></nav><div class="mb-6 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-white px-5 py-3 shadow-lg"><img width="800" height="450" src="/case/driveguard/driveguard-logo.webp" alt="Drive Guard logo" class="h-8 w-auto"></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="border-color:#29a3dc55;color:#29a3dc;background:#29a3dc14"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background:#29a3dc"></span> <!-- -->Fleet Safety Platform</span><h1 class="mt-5 font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] text-dusk sm:text-5xl">Drive Guard</h1><p class="mt-3 font-display text-xl font-medium" style="color:#29a3dc">Safer roads for every fleet</p><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-dusk/75">Drive Guard is a fleet-safety platform that helps companies running large driving fleets, couriers, rideshare, trucking, and government agencies, keep drivers compliant and roads safer. It pairs real-time route monitoring, in-app compliance checks, and one-tap emergency response with a standout feature that silences on-screen message alerts the moment a driver is on the road.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><button class="btn-primary !px-8 !py-3.5">Start a project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><a class="btn-ghost !px-8 !py-3.5" href="/case-studies">All case studies</a></div></div><div class="relative flex justify-center"><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 m-auto h-72 w-72 rounded-full blur-[90px]" style="background:#29a3dc22" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative w-full max-w-[250px] z-10 -rotate-3"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2.1rem] border-[6px] border-[#0a121e] bg-[#0a121e] shadow-[0_30px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"><img width="1200" height="675" src="/case/driveguard/dg-01.webp" alt="Drive Guard app" loading="lazy" class="block w-full"></div></div><div class="relative w-full max-w-[250px] !absolute bottom-0 right-0 hidden w-[42%] translate-x-6 translate-y-6 rotate-6 sm:block"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2.1rem] border-[6px] border-[#0a121e] bg-[#0a121e] shadow-[0_30px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"><img width="1200" height="675" src="/case/driveguard/dg-15.webp" alt="Drive Guard app screen" loading="lazy" class="block w-full"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-dusk/10 bg-dusk/10 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="bg-ink/80 p-5"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-dusk/45">Industry</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-dusk">Fleet Safety · Transportation</p></div><div class="bg-ink/80 p-5"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-dusk/45">Platform</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-dusk">iOS · Android · Web</p></div><div class="bg-ink/80 p-5"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-dusk/45">Scope</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-dusk">Design · AI engineering · Full build</p></div><div class="bg-ink/80 p-5"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-dusk/45">Timeline</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-dusk">135–160 working days</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative px-5 py-14 sm:px-8"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><span class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-dusk/85" style="border-color:#29a3dc33;background:#29a3dc0f">Silences texts while driving</span><span class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-dusk/85" style="border-color:#29a3dc33;background:#29a3dc0f">Real-time route &amp; fleet tracking</span><span class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-dusk/85" style="border-color:#29a3dc33;background:#29a3dc0f">One-tap Emergency SOS</span><span class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-dusk/85" style="border-color:#29a3dc33;background:#29a3dc0f">Compliance-based driver rating</span><span class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-dusk/85" style="border-color:#29a3dc33;background:#29a3dc0f">Three connected roles</span><span class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-dusk/85" style="border-color:#29a3dc33;background:#29a3dc0f">iOS, Android &amp; Web</span></div></section><section class="section-pad relative !py-14"><canvas class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full " style="opacity:0.35" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><div class="glass h-full p-8 md:p-10"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="color:#29a3dc">The Challenge</span><p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-dusk/75">Distracted driving is a leading cause of fleet accidents, yet operators had little visibility into driver behaviour or compliance on the road. The client needed one system that could curb phone distractions, track routes and ratings in real time, connect drivers to emergency help instantly, and give fleet owners and administrators oversight, without overwhelming drivers or compromising data security.</p></div></div><div class="h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><div class="glass h-full p-8 md:p-10"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="color:#29a3dc">Our Solution</span><p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-dusk/75">DigiWorks designed and engineered Drive Guard end-to-end across three connected interfaces: a driver mobile app on iOS and Android, a fleet-owner web dashboard, and a super-admin panel. The app suppresses incoming message alerts while driving, shares live routes, scores drivers on traffic-law compliance, and triggers an Emergency SOS to predefined contacts and local services. Fleet owners monitor status, routes and ratings live, while admins manage roles, users and analytics, all on a secure, encrypted, GDPR-compliant backend.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section-pad relative !py-14"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><span class="chip"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-coral"></span>One System</span></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-dusk sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"><span class="text-dusk">Built for three<!-- --> </span><span class="text-gradient">connected roles</span></h2></div><div class="mt-5 h-[3px] w-24 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan via-electric to-violet shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(26,130,255,0.8)] mx-auto" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)"></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-dusk/75 md:text-lg">A driver app, a fleet-owner dashboard, and a super-admin panel, working as one.</p></div></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(36px)"><div class="glass glare relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden p-7"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-white" style="background:#29a3dc"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6 fill-none stroke-current" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 11l1.5-4.5A2 2 0 018.4 5h7.2a2 2 0 011.9 1.5L19 11m-14 0h14m-14 0v6m14-6v6M7 17h.01M17 17h.01M5 17h14v-6H5z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-bold text-dusk">Driver App</h3><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color:#29a3dc">iOS &amp; Android</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-dusk/70">Drivers si